L249: Acknowledgements
L250: We would like to thank Esther Boelsma (hospital Gelderse Vallei, Ede, the Netherlands) for helping out find available rooms for performing the study; we would like to thank Bas Maresh and Myrthe Vestering for helping out and preparing the ultrasound protocols. We would also like to give thanks to Karin van den Brink who built the functional test package for this study with her expertise as (sports) physical therapist. We would like to acknowledge Prof. Dr. HC Boshuizen for her advisory role in the statistical methods.
