L254: I have read the information letter. I was also able to ask questions. My questions were answered well enough. I had enough time to decide whether to participate.
L255: I know that participating is voluntary. I also know that I can decide at any time not to participate in the study after all. Or to stop. I do not have to say why I want to stop.
L256: I give the researchers permission to inform my general practitioner and if applicable, physical therapist, about my participation in this study.
L257: I give the researchers permission to give my GP or specialist information about unexpected findings from the study that are important to my health.
L258: I give the researchers permission to collect and use my data and body material. The researchers do this only to answer the research question of this study.
L259: I know that for the purpose of monitoring the study, some people related to the study may see my data. Those people are listed in the information letter. I give these people permission to see my data for this audit.
